## Parallelization note

The Claude Code version of this skill dispatches specialist subagents in parallel — one ANALYST per source, one SCOUT per competitor tier, one COPYWRITER per page section, one SCRIPTWRITER per platform. If your tool can't dispatch subagents, run the work **sequentially with the same prompts**. The structure, references, and frameworks are identical; only the wall-clock time changes.

